From 6be6dd20e4e20a6f23585cf1cb129e9a649d057d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:05:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] brand: the portal itself as the connect control
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The legacy client replaced the power button with a living portal: a breathing core
with two rings turning in opposite directions. The hero dashboard gets the same
control, drawn with a CustomPainter, and the label under it is the action itself
(«Открыть портал» / «Закрыть портал») instead of the engine's start/stop wording.
Motion is skipped when the platform asks for reduced animations.
